  "duration_s": 84.078005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "小王啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这就剩半辈了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。小王啊，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，我先敬您打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪敢啊？我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。小李，最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思，领导也要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯。怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。哈哈哈啊哈你酒量挺好的呀，领导您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝。这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。关注我，每天学点儿高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1410,
      "end_ms": 3270,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3270,
      "end_ms": 4350,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4550,
      "end_ms": 10150,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10790,
      "end_ms": 11030,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11030,
      "end_ms": 12210,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12210,
      "end_ms": 13490,
      "text": "怎么到我这就剩半辈了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13670,
      "end_ms": 15110,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15210,
      "end_ms": 16190,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16309,
      "end_ms": 18390,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20030,
      "end_ms": 21570,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22250,
      "end_ms": 24330,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24330,
      "end_ms": 26490,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28950,
      "end_ms": 29450,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 32080,
      "end_ms": 33700,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33700,
      "end_ms": 36040,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36100,
      "end_ms": 39280,
      "text": "我先敬您打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39420,
      "end_ms": 40180,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 40400,
      "end_ms": 40840,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40840,
      "end_ms": 41620,
      "text": "我哪敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41760,
      "end_ms": 43880,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43900,
      "end_ms": 45500,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45660,
      "end_ms": 47000,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 48280,
      "end_ms": 48640,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 48640,
      "end_ms": 49760,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50040,
      "end_ms": 51840,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 51940,
      "end_ms": 53140,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 53300,
      "end_ms": 54000,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 54040,
      "end_ms": 55280,
      "text": "领导也要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 55280,
      "end_ms": 56640,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 58400,
      "end_ms": 59520,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60040,
      "end_ms": 61415,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 62390,
      "end_ms": 63390,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63430,
      "end_ms": 64875,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 65130,
      "end_ms": 66765,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 67190,
      "end_ms": 70005,
      "text": "哈哈哈啊哈你酒量挺好的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 70360,
      "end_ms": 71880,
      "text": "领导您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 71960,
      "end_ms": 73060,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 73260,
      "end_ms": 74700,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 74700,
      "end_ms": 75320,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 75320,
      "end_ms": 77425,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 78490,
      "end_ms": 79045,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 79380,
      "end_ms": 80980,
      "text": "每天学点儿高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 80980,
      "end_ms": 81695,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_886b895da27e66f2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 82000,
      "end_ms": 83875,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
